### listar con paginacion y busqueda
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor?limit=5&search=comercial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### crear
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "razon_social": "Distribuidora Comercial S.A.",
    "nro_identificacion": "1020304012",
    "contacto": "Carlos Ramirez",
    "telefono": "2234567",
    "correo": "ventas@comercial.com",
    "observaciones": "Proveedor principal de abarrotes",
    "estado": true
}

### crear sin opcionales
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "razon_social": "Proveedor Importaciones Ltda."
}

### crear con datos invalidos (espera 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "razon_social": "",
    "correo": "no-es-un-correo"
}

### mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### mostrar inexistente (espera 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### modificar
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "razon_social": "Distribuidora Comercial Actualizada S.A.",
    "nro_identificacion": "1020304012",
    "contacto": "Carlos Ramirez",
    "telefono": "2239999",
    "correo": "ventas@comercial.com",
    "observaciones": "Actualizado",
    "estado": true
}

### modificar con datos invalidos (espera 422)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "correo": "correo-invalido"
}

### eliminar
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proveedor/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
